{
  "fixtureMeta": {
    "title": "V04e MIDI out (Creative): the V04c zones room; In zone (Stage) -> Mod Out 1 + MIDI note gate C3 (60) ch 1; Zone index -> Mod Out 2 + keyswitch base C1 (36) ch 2 with program change",
    "valueSources": {
      "document.zones": "derived-by-hand",
      "document.modulation": "derived-by-hand",
      "parameters.values.mode": "derived-by-hand",
      "document.scene": "code",
      "document.sources": "code",
      "host": "protocol-example",
      "revision/sceneSerial/loadSerial": "protocol-example"
    },
    "notes": [
      "Zone 1 'Stage' (box 2..4 x 5..7 m, floor..ceiling) contains Source 1 (3, 6, 1.5).",
      "Zone 2 'Tiles' (concave polygon, soft edge 0.3 m) does not contain the listener (3, 2, 1.5) in the default pose.",
      "Mock occupancy is stateless (no hysteresis / sweep); the processor adds both.",
      "route.midi is optional; routes without it are identical to V04c documents.",
      "The mock emulates the MIDI indicator (status.load modulation.routes[i].midi); the processor sends real MIDI only while the host transport plays."
    ],
    "unverified": [
      "status.load.zones occupancy is emitted by the processor only while audio runs"
    ]
  },
